       RECONCILE-STATUS-CODE-0127.
               UNSTRING WS-KEY-CHAR DELIMITED BY '/'
                             INTO WS-KEY-CUSTOMER
                                  WS-KEY-POLICY
               END-UNSTRING.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       RESOLVE-BEDROOMS-0128.
